@api = http://localhost:5080

### Stations (seeded by EcoStream.DbMigrator)
GET {{api}}/api/stations

### Latest reading per station
GET {{api}}/api/telemetry/latest

### Last 24h series for a station
GET {{api}}/api/stations/A801/readings

### Neighborhoods within 3 km of Centro Histórico (PostGIS ST_DWithin)
GET {{api}}/api/geo/neighborhoods/near?lat=-30.0330&lon=-51.2300&radiusKm=3

### Manual reading — normal
POST {{api}}/api/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stationCode": "POA-CENTRO", "measuredAt": "2026-11-01T12:00:00Z",
  "rainfallMmPerHour": 4.2, "windGustKmh": 22, "pressureHpa": 1012 }

### Manual reading — severe anomaly (publishes AnomalyDetectedIntegrationEvent)
POST {{api}}/api/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stationCode": "POA-CENTRO", "measuredAt": "2026-11-01T13:00:00Z",
  "rainfallMmPerHour": 72.5, "windGustKmh": 104, "pressureHpa": 978 }
